OFFICIAL WINDOWS CONTRACT CHECK

Python os.open:
  https://docs.python.org/3/library/os.html#os.open
  On Windows, O_BINARY is required to open the descriptor in binary mode.

Microsoft CRT translation modes:
  https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/c-runtime-library/translation-mode-constants?view=msvc-170
  Text mode translates LF/CRLF; _O_BINARY suppresses translation.

Microsoft LockFileEx:
  https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/fileapi/nf-fileapi-lockfileex
  A second handle opened by the same process cannot access the exclusively
  locked range until it is unlocked.

